# Project TITAN V1.0 — UI & Menu Baseline

**Companion rule:** See `project-titan-development-standard.mdc` for full Development Standard (PM Final).

**Status:** Menu structure PM-approved (8 sidebar items). HOME implemented. Next: 입출고관리 screen design.

## Development Workflow (Mandatory)

See `DEVELOPMENT_PROCESS` in `src/config/developmentStandard.js`:

기획 → 화면 설계 → PM 승인 → Cursor 개발 → 테스트 → 수정 → 다음 화면

## Menu Architecture (Fixed — 8 Sidebar Items)

### Sidebar — 1Depth only

`HOME` · `입출고관리` · `생산관리` · `품질관리` · `개인업무` · `통계자료` · `기준정보관리` · `환경설정`

Source: `src/config/menuStructure.js` → `SIDEBAR_MENU`

**No separate 출고관리 in sidebar** — merged under 입출고관리.

### Sub-functions — Top tabs per section

| Section | Tabs |
|---------|------|
| 입출고관리 | 입고관리 · 출고관리 |
| 생산관리 | **생산일보** · 생산실적관리 |
| 품질관리 | 검사일지 · 성적서관리 |
| 개인업무 | 업무대기 · 진행현황 · 업무일지 |
| 통계자료 | 이력조회 · 영업실적 |
| 기준정보관리 | 업체 · 품목 · 작업자 · 설비 · 코드 |
| 환경설정 | 프로그램 · 저장경로 · 사용자 · 백업 / 복원 · 시스템정보 |

입출고관리 탭 내 기능(화면 설계 시 구현): see `INOUT_TAB_FEATURES` in `menuStructure.js`.

Future features are added as **tabs only** — sidebar does not change.

## Official Workflow

입고 등록 → 작업지시서 출력 → 생산부 전달 → 생산정보 등록 → 검사일지 → 성적서 발행 → 출고 → 이력조회

## UI Principles

- Sidebar: **1Depth only** · sub-functions: **top Tab menu**
- List-first (~86% list / side max ~240px)
- Search: essential only · **"추가 옵션"** for advanced (collapsed)
- Detail: collapse panel, default expanded
- Right panel: optional, not fixed on every screen
- Design freeze after PM approval

## Screen Build Order

✅ HOME · ✅ 메뉴 구조 → **입출고관리** (next) → 생산관리 → …

## Foundation Paths

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Menu config | `src/config/menuStructure.js` |
| Router | `src/router/AppRouter.jsx` |
| Routes prefix | `/inout`, `/production`, `/quality`, … |

## Table (TitanDataTable — PM 공통 리스트)

- **All list screens** must use `TitanDataTable` from `src/foundation/components/DataTable.jsx`.
- **CSS:** `.titan-table*` classes in `src/foundation/components/components.css` + tokens in `src/foundation/styles/tokens.css`.
- **Do not** create page-specific table CSS (no `.inbound-table`, per-page hover borders, etc.).

### Style rules

| Element | Rule |
|---------|------|
| Header bg | `#e3e9f0` (`--titan-table-header`, PM 3차) |
| Header border | `#d5dee8` (`--titan-table-header-border`) |
| Header text | `#1e293b` (`--titan-table-header-text`) |
| Row bg | White (`--titan-surface`) |
| Border | `#dde6f0` (`--titan-table-border`) |
| Hover | Background only `#f3f7fc` — **no border/outline on hover** |
| Selected/active row | Background `#edf4fd` only — **no border emphasis** |
| Checkbox | `.titan-table__checkbox` — selection state via checkbox + light blue row bg |

### Usage

```jsx
import TitanDataTable from "../../foundation/components/DataTable";
// or: import { TitanDataTable } from "../../foundation";
```

Future screens (출고관리, 생산관리, 품질관리, 통계자료, 기준정보관리): use `TitanDataTable` + shared `Pagination` only.

## Search Panel (TitanSearchPanel — 공통 CRUD)

- **Basic search (always visible):** 업체명 · 품명 · 품번 · 재질 (4 fields, fixed height)
- **Actions (right):** `[조회]` · `[초기화]` · `[▼ 상세검색]` / `[▲ 상세검색 닫기]`
- **Advanced:** page-specific fields in `TitanAdvancedSearch` (collapse/expand, ~0.25s animation)
- **State persistence:** `useAdvancedSearchOpen(storageKey)` — sessionStorage for open/closed
- Config: `src/config/listSearchStandard.js`

## List Footer (TitanTableFooter)

All list screens use identical footer layout:

| Left | Center | Right |
|------|--------|-------|
| 총 N건 | ◀ 1 2 3 ▶ | 페이지당 [10▼] 건 |

- Column widths: `src/config/tableColumnPresets.js` — **widthPercent (%) only**, no per-page px widths
- Key ratios (PM 3차): 업체명 13% · 품명 22% · 품번 14%

- Page sizes: 10 · 20 · 30 · 50 · 100
- Hook: `useListPagination(items)` for paging logic

## Right Panel (TitanDetailPanel — list-centered screens)

Order is fixed for all management screens with a right panel:

1. **상세정보** (CollapsePanel, default open)
2. Divider
3. **Screen action button** (100% width, shared PrimaryButton style)
4. Divider
5. **공정 흐름도** (vertical flow, bottom of panel)

Component: `src/foundation/components/TitanDetailPanel.jsx`

Screen buttons: 입고관리 `작업지시서 출력` · 출고관리 `거래명세서 출력` · 생산일보 `생산일보 출력` · 검사일지/성적서관리 per screen purpose.

## Product List Column Standard (생산일보 기준)

Default column order: 관리번호 · LOT.NO · 업체명 · 품명 · 품번 · 재질 · 수량 · 공정 · 작업일 · 현재상태 · 등록일

- List column **수량** only (not 입고수량/출고수량/작업수량); detail panel may use typed qty labels.
- **LOT.NO** is the only LOT label in lists/search.
- **공정** dropdown: 이온질화 · 연질화 (extensible via code management).
- Helper: `buildStandardProductListColumns()` in `src/config/standardProductList.js`

## Terminology

- **공정 흐름표** → **공정 흐름도** (project-wide)
- Do not use `오늘` in user-facing text; use `금일`, `전일`, etc.

## Register Modal (TitanRegisterModal — 공통 등록)

- All register actions use modal popup on current page (no navigation).
- Component: `src/foundation/components/TitanRegisterModal.jsx`
- Labels: `src/config/registerModalStandard.js`
- Footer: `[취소]` · `[등록]` — register saves, refreshes list, closes modal.
- Modal: ~78vw max 960px, semi-transparent overlay, ESC / X to close.

Inbound labels: `입고 등록` · print button `입고 리스트 (열처리 작업 요청 리스트)`.

## Text Wrap (단어 단위 줄바꿈)

- Buttons, titles, cards use **word-based** line breaks — never mid-character (`word-break: keep-all`).
- Long button labels use intentional 2-line design via `\n` in `registerModalStandard.js`.
- Component: `TitanMultilineText` · helper: `formatTitanButtonLabel()` in `src/utils/titanTextWrap.js`.
- `PrimaryButton` / `SecondaryButton` auto-wrap string children.
- Parentheses stay together: `입고 리스트` + newline + `(열처리 작업 요청 리스트)`.
- Button height grows up to ~2 lines; do not shrink font size to fit.

## Register Modal Summary Card

- Component: `TitanRegisterSummaryText` · helper: `formatTitanSummaryText()`.
- Wrapper class: `.titan-register-summary` on summary aside/card.
- Parentheses on own line: `자동 생성 예정` + `(업체코드_날짜_순번)`.
- `word-break: keep-all` · card height auto-grows · no font shrinking.

## Legacy

- Legacy `/incoming`, `/shipment` routes redirect to `/inout/incoming`, `/inout/shipment`
